<title>UK: Expro gains as Cazenove ups price target.</title>
<headline>Expro gains as Cazenove ups price target.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Expro International Plc shot higher on Tuesday as analysts at Cazenove, the company's broker, issued a &quot;buy&quot; recommendation and raised their 12-month price target on the stock to 580p, market sources said.</p>
<p>Expro, which surveys and manages oil and natural gas wells, was up 40-1/2p or 8.8 percent at 498 by 1039 GMT in volume of just over half a million shares.</p>
<p>No-one at Cazenove could be reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
